                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= PROGRAMS ================= -->
<section class="py-5 py-lg-6">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head text-center reveal mb-4 mb-lg-5">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Academic departments</p>
            <h2 class="section-title text-navy">Programs that build careers</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="school-card card h-100 reveal" style="--i:0">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <span class="icon-box icon-gold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-cpu"></i></span>
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-navy">School of Computing and Information Technology</h3>
                        <p class="small fw-semibold text-gold-deep mb-2">Example programs: BCA, B.Sc. Computer Science, MCA</p>
                        <p class="text-secondary mb-0">
                            Develop programming, software development, database management,
                            networking, and problem-solving skills.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="school-card card h-100 reveal" style="--i:1">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <span class="icon-box icon-gold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-bezier2"></i></span>
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-navy">School of Science</h3>
                        <p class="small fw-semibold text-gold-deep mb-2">
                            Example programs: B.Sc. Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-secondary mb-0">
                            Build scientific understanding through theoretical study, laboratory
                            practice, and analytical thinking.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="school-card card h-100 reveal" style="--i:2">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <span class="icon-box icon-gold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></span>
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-navy">School of Commerce and Management</h3>
                        <p class="small fw-semibold text-gold-deep mb-2">Example programs: B.Com, BBA, MBA</p>
